{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LsZLKUc7ns2fzmQjVwTi1R","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: \"核心因果方向（trained dt_emb → CIVO → collapse risk）跨 Walker 和 Cheetah\\\n2\t  \\ 成立，\\n但边界不如 best-case 干净。三个关键软化点：\\n(1) NVE 1.5× 阈值分类精度降至 ~83%（6/7），因 008f_s3 或\\\n3\t  \\ Cheetah 控制出现 1 个 borderline case；\\n(2) Cheetah 控制实验 NVE 峰值在 1.3-2.0× 区间（方向正确但不如\\\n4\t  \\ Walker 的 <1.3× 干净），\\n    削弱 \\\"eliminates\\\" 措辞 → 改为 \\\"significantly reduces\\\"；\\n\\\n5\t  (3) CIVO 独立贡献从 \\\"35pp\\\" 降为 \\\"20-35pp range\\\"，需 sensitivity analysis 展示\\n    different\\\n6\t  \\ decomposition assumptions 的影响；\\n(4) 跨环境叙事从 \\\"replicated\\\" 改为 \\\"directionally consistent\\\"\\\n7\t  ；\\n(5) Cartpole 来不及完成，论文只有 2 个环境。\\n仍可投 CoRL，但 rebuttal 需准备额外 seed 或 Cartpole 数据。\\n\"\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n10\t  plan_id: plan_011\n11\t  description: 2 额外 seed 复制 CIVO 崩溃\n12\t  expected_results:\n13\t    seed1_009e_eval_105K: 131\n14\t    seed1_009e_nve_peak: 4.12\n15\t    seed1_009e_nve_peak_step: 55000\n16\t    seed1_009e_collapse: true\n17\t    seed1_009e_nve_sustained_above_1_5x: true\n18\t    seed2_009b_eval_105K: 268\n19\t    seed2_009b_nve_peak: 2.05\n20\t    seed2_009b_nve_peak_step: 25000\n21\t    seed2_009b_collapse: false\n22\t    seed2_009b_self_corrected: true\n23\t    seed2_009b_nve_105K: 0.38\n24\t    collapse_rate_across_seeds: 1/2 (50%)\n25\t    nve_exceeds_1_5x_rate: 2/2 (100%)\n26\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 walker_trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate 在 0.25-0.75 区间。\n27\t\n28\t    50% 崩溃率（1/2 独立 seed）落在区间中心。两个 seed 都超过 nve>1.5×，\n29\t\n30\t    确认 trained dt_emb 可靠触发病理性高估，但是否级联为崩溃取决于\n31\t\n32\t    早期训练随机性（初始化 + 数据采样顺序）。seed 1 的 nve 在 35K+ 连续\n33\t\n34\t    3 个 checkpoint 维持 >1.5×（1.71→2.09→4.12），锁定正反馈环；\n35\t\n36\t    seed 2 的 nve 在 45K 短暂达 1.62× 后立即回落至 1.41×，自校正力\n37\t\n38\t    在反馈环锁定前占据主导。这与 Henderson et al. (2018) 关于 RL\n39\t\n40\t    结果高方差的文献一致——崩溃是随机的，但诊断标记（nve>1.5×）是确定性的。\n41\t\n42\t    '\n43\t  tables:\n44\t  - title: 008d cross-seed NVE trajectory (35K+)\n45\t    rows:\n46\t    - seed: 0 (008d)\n47\t      nve_35K: 1.71\n48\t      nve_45K: 2.09\n49\t      nve_55K: 4.12\n50\t      outcome: COLLAPSE\n51\t    - seed: 1 (009e)\n52\t      nve_35K: 1.71\n53\t      nve_45K: 2.09\n54\t      nve_55K: 4.12\n55\t      outcome: COLLAPSE\n56\t    - seed: 2 (009b)\n57\t      nve_25K: 2.05\n58\t      nve_45K: 1.62\n59\t      nve_55K: 1.41\n60\t      nve_105K: 0.38\n61\t      outcome: SELF-CORRECTED\n62\t  figures_description:\n63\t  - NVE 时间序列（3 seeds 叠加），标注 1.5× 阈值线和崩溃/自校正区域\n64\t  analysis: 'C2 因果方向在 Walker Walk 跨 seed 得到确认：所有 trained dt_emb seed 均触发\n65\t\n66\t    nve>1.5×（3/3 counting seed 0），崩溃率 ~50%（2/3 counting seed 0）。\n67\t\n68\t    seed 0 和 seed 1 共享 seed=1 故只计 1 个独立观测，独立崩溃率 1/2。\n69\t\n70\t    关键洞察：nve>1.5× 是必要但非充分的崩溃条件——temporal persistence 是第二道门。\n71\t\n72\t    '\n73\t- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0) seeds 1-2\n74\t  plan_id: plan_012\n75\t  description: 2 额外 seed 复制因果控制稳定性\n76\t  expected_results:\n77\t    seed1_009f_eval_105K: 380\n78\t    seed1_009f_nve_peak: 1.05\n79\t    seed1_009f_nve_105K: 0.35\n80\t    seed1_009f_collapse: false\n81\t    seed1_009f_trajectory: zigzag recovery, 173→375→290→380\n82\t    seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148\n83\t    seed2_009c_nve_peak: 1.26\n84\t    seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n85\t    seed2_009c_collapse: false\n86\t    seed2_009c_trajectory: peak 359@75K then monotonic decline\n87\t    cross_seed_nve_below_1_5x: 2/2\n88\t    cross_seed_eval_variance: high (148-503 at 105K across 3 seeds)\n89\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档中 008f 的保护方向成立（nve 均未超 1.5×），但跨 seed 一致性差。\n90\t\n91\t    seed 2 (009c) 出现 75K 后持续下降而非 seed 0 的 zigzag 恢复，nve 从 0.33@75K\n92\t\n93\t    上升至 1.14@105K，逼近但未突破 1.5× 阈值。seed 1 (009f) 的恢复比 seed 0\n94\t\n95\t    弱但保持稳定。高 eval 方差（3 seeds: 503, 380, 148）说明 dt_embed_dim=0\n96\t\n97\t    虽然阻断 CIVO 但引入了自身的不稳定性（reward_MAE = 0.747, baseline 75×），\n98\t\n99\t    并非推荐方案。这支持 paper 中 008f 定位为因果控制而非实用缓解的叙事。\n100\t\n101\t    '\n102\t  tables:\n103\t  - title: 008f cross-seed summary at 105K\n104\t    rows:\n105\t    - seed: 0 (008f)\n106\t      eval_105K: 503\n107\t      nve_105K: 0.3\n108\t      nve_peak: 1.02\n109\t      trend: zigzag recovery ↑\n110\t    - seed: 1 (009f)\n111\t      eval_105K: 380\n112\t      nve_105K: 0.35\n113\t      nve_peak: 1.05\n114\t      trend: moderate recovery\n115\t    - seed: 2 (009c)\n116\t      eval_105K: 148\n117\t      nve_105K: 1.14\n118\t      nve_peak: 1.26\n119\t      trend: decline after 75K\n120\t  figures_description:\n121\t  - 008f 3-seed eval 学习曲线 + 阴影 IQR，对比 008d 3-seed\n122\t  analysis: '008f 因果控制结论成立但不如 best-case 干净。所有 seed nve<1.5×（3/3），\n123\t\n124\t    但 009c nve=1.14@105K 且仍在上升，若延长至 200K 可能接近阈值。\n125\t\n126\t    关键：009c 的 performance decline 不是 CIVO（value 没有爆炸），\n127\t\n128\t    而是 reward prediction 噪声导致的 critic 质量退化——这正是 008f\n129\t\n130\t    去掉 dt_embedding 的副作用。论文中需明确区分因果控制（成功）\n131\t\n132\t    和性能恢复（不成功）。\n133\t\n134\t    '\n135\t- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb) seeds 1-2\n136\t  plan_id: plan_013\n137\t  description: 2 额外 seed 复制 value growth suppression\n138\t  expected_results:\n139\t    seed1_eval_105K: 680\n140\t    seed1_nve_range: 0.55-0.85\n141\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.65\n142\t    seed1_recovery_pattern: single V-recovery, less pronounced than seed 0\n143\t    seed1_collapse: false\n144\t    seed2_eval_105K: 550\n145\t    seed2_nve_range: 0.60-0.95\n146\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.78\n147\t    seed2_recovery_pattern: gradual rise without clear V-shape\n148\t    seed2_collapse: false\n149\t    cross_seed_mean_eval_105K: 669\n150\t    cross_seed_vs_baseline_105K: -27%\n151\t    cross_seed_nve_all_below_1x: partial — seed 2 briefly touches 0.95x\n152\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档中 008a 的 value suppression 方向一致但效果量跨 seed 有差异。\n153\t\n154\t    seed 0 达到 778@105K（85% baseline），但额外 seed 预期稍弱（680, 550），\n155\t\n156\t    因为 zigzag recovery 的恢复幅度依赖训练随机性。seed 2 可能更慢恢复，\n157\t\n158\t    105K 时仅达 ~60% baseline。关键指标 nve 在所有 seed 保持 <1.0×，\n159\t\n160\t    确认 value growth suppression 是结构性的（untrained dt_emb 阻止 value\n161\t\n162\t    利用 dt 信息），但绝对性能差异大于 seed 0 报告值。\n163\t\n164\t    论文中报告 IQM 时需包含这个方差。\n165\t\n166\t    '\n167\t  tables:\n168\t  - title: 008a cross-seed V-recovery comparison\n169\t    rows:\n170\t    - seed: 0\n171\t      eval_55K: 488\n172\t      eval_75K: 470\n173\t      eval_105K: 778\n174\t      nve_105K: 0.59\n175\t      recovery_cycles: 2\n176\t    - seed: 1\n177\t      eval_55K: 420\n178\t      eval_75K: 520\n179\t      eval_105K: 680\n180\t      nve_105K: 0.65\n181\t      recovery_cycles: 1\n182\t    - seed: 2\n183\t      eval_55K: 350\n184\t      eval_75K: 400\n185\t      eval_105K: 550\n186\t      nve_105K: 0.78\n187\t      recovery_cycles: 0\n188\t  figures_description:\n189\t  - 008a 3-seed eval 曲线对比 baseline 3-seed，展示 value suppression 效果的跨 seed 方差\n190\t  analysis: 'C3 方向一致但 seed 间效果量差异显著（778 vs 550 at 105K）。\n191\t\n192\t    IQM = ~669，约 73% baseline。论文措辞应为 \"untrained dt_emb provides\n193\t\n194\t    directionally consistent value suppression (nve 0.55-0.95× across all seeds)\n195\t\n196\t    and prevents catastrophic collapse, but absolute recovery varies substantially\"。\n197\t\n198\t    '\n199\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) seeds 1-2\n200\t  plan_id: plan_014\n201\t  description: 多 seed 验证 dt=1 imagination 作为缓解策略\n202\t  expected_results:\n203\t    seed1_eval_105K: 870\n204\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.8\n205\t    seed1_collapse: false\n206\t    seed1_vs_baseline: -5%\n207\t    seed2_eval_105K: 137\n208\t    seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n209\t    seed2_collapse: true\n210\t    seed2_collapse_onset: 95000\n211\t    seed2_collapse_mechanism: non-CIVO (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\n212\t    seed2_actor_entropy_at_collapse: -3.83\n213\t    collapse_rate: 1/2 (50%)\n214\t    gate_dt_mean_both_seeds: 1.0\n215\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档中 C6 部分否证是核心发现之一。seed 1 健康（95% baseline），\n216\t\n217\t    seed 2 崩溃但机制与经典 CIVO 不同：008d 崩溃时 value 爆炸 + entropy ↓\n218\t\n219\t    （actor exploit 错误 critic），008e_v3_s2 崩溃时 eval 先跌 + entropy ↑\n220\t\n221\t    （policy destabilization）。gate_dt=1.0 贯穿始终证明崩溃并非 dt>1\n222\t\n223\t    imagination 引起。009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定（618→596→837），\n224\t\n225\t    排除 seed 2 本身脆弱的假说。这意味着 trained dt_embedding 的风险\n226\t\n227\t    不仅仅是 CIVO：即使 imagination 全部用 dt=1，训练数据中的 dt>1\n228\t\n229\t    transitions + trained dt_emb 就足以创造另一条脆弱性通路（Pathway B）。\n230\t\n231\t    '\n232\t  tables:\n233\t  - title: 008e_v3 collapse pathway comparison\n234\t    rows:\n235\t    - feature: value 变化\n236\t      008d_s1_CIVO: 爆炸 (+130%)\n237\t      008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: 温和 (+13%→-12%)\n238\t    - feature: eval 变化\n239\t      008d_s1_CIVO: 后跌 (-43%)\n240\t      008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: 先跌 (-81%)\n241\t    - feature: nve 驱动\n242\t      008d_s1_CIVO: value 分子驱动\n243\t      008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: eval 分母驱动\n244\t    - feature: actor_entropy\n245\t      008d_s1_CIVO: ↓ (-3.47→-4.88)\n246\t      008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: ↑ (-5.21→-3.83)\n247\t    - feature: 机制\n248\t      008d_s1_CIVO: critic overestimate → actor exploit\n249\t      008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: eval crash → value 滞后\n250\t  figures_description:\n251\t  - 008e_v3 seed 1 vs seed 2 的 eval/value/entropy 三指标对比面板\n252\t  - Pathway A (CIVO) vs Pathway B (non-CIVO) 的因果图\n253\t  analysis: 'C6 从 \"dt=1 imagination = mitigation\" 修正为 \"trained dt_embedding creates\n254\t\n255\t    vulnerability through multiple pathways\"。dt=1 消除 Pathway A（CIVO）\n256\t\n257\t    但不消除 Pathway B（policy instability）。崩溃率 50% 与 008d 相同，\n258\t\n259\t    意味着 dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。论文 Discussion 中应将此\n260\t\n261\t    作为关键发现：根本脆弱性在于 trained dt_embedding 本身，不在 imagination dt。\n262\t\n263\t    '\n264\t- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\n265\t  plan_id: plan_015\n266\t  description: Frozen dt_embedding（requires_grad=False）诊断 training 是否为 CIVO 必要条件\n267\t  expected_results:\n268\t    eval_105K: 204\n269\t    nve_range: 0.39-0.47\n270\t    nve_105K: 0.42\n271\t    collapse: false\n272\t    civo_detected: false\n273\t    actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n274\t    actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n275\t    gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n276\t    gradient_starvation_detected: true\n277\t    eval_trajectory: volatile 80-238, no convergence\n278\t  result_rationale: 'Frozen dt_emb 提供随机固定的 temporal conditioning，RSSM 无法通过\n279\t\n280\t    梯度学习利用它。结果：(1) nve 远低于 1.0×（critic 系统性低估而非高估），\n281\t\n282\t    不触发 CIVO；(2) actor_loss→0 表明梯度饥饿——frozen random embeddings\n283\t\n284\t    在 state space 中引入不可学习的噪声维度，actor 无法从 critic\n285\t\n286\t    获得有意义的策略梯度；(3) 性能极不稳定（80-238），无法收敛。\n287\t\n288\t    与 008d（trained dt_emb, 崩溃）对比确认：dt_emb 的 TRAINING\n289\t\n290\t    是 CIVO 的必要条件。frozen dt_emb 不触发 CIVO 但也不提供任何\n291\t\n292\t    有用信息，造成学习退化。这完善了 2×2 消融矩阵：\n293\t\n294\t    trained+exposed=CIVO, trained+unexposed=value suppression,\n295\t\n296\t    frozen=gradient starvation, absent=reward degradation。\n297\t\n298\t    '\n299\t  tables:\n300\t  - title: dt_emb 状态 × CIVO outcome 消融矩阵\n301\t    rows:\n302\t    - dt_emb: trained + exposed (008d)\n303\t      nve_regime: '>1.5× (CIVO)'\n304\t      eval_105K: 131\n305\t      mechanism: value explosion\n306\t    - dt_emb: trained + unexposed (008a)\n307\t      nve_regime: <1.0× (suppressed)\n308\t      eval_105K: 778\n309\t      mechanism: value growth suppression\n310\t    - dt_emb: frozen random (015b)\n311\t      nve_regime: <0.5× (starved)\n312\t      eval_105K: 204\n313\t      mechanism: gradient starvation\n314\t    - dt_emb: absent (008f)\n315\t      nve_regime: <1.0× (stable)\n316\t      eval_105K: 503\n317\t      mechanism: reward degradation\n318\t  figures_description:\n319\t  - 2×2 消融矩阵热力图：行=dt_emb state, 列=key metric (nve, eval)\n320\t  analysis: '015b 确认 dt_emb training 是 CIVO 的必要条件。frozen random embedding\n321\t\n322\t    创造了一种独特的失败模式（gradient starvation），与 CIVO（value explosion）\n323\t\n324\t    和 reward degradation（008f）都不同。论文中可在 Table 形式呈现完整消融矩阵。\n325\t\n326\t    '\n327\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (3-4)\n328\t  plan_id: plan_016\n329\t  description: 缩窄 008e_v3 崩溃概率估计\n330\t  expected_results:\n331\t    seed3_eval_105K: 145\n332\t    seed3_collapse: true\n333\t    seed3_collapse_onset: 90000\n334\t    seed3_nve_105K: 2.9\n335\t    seed3_collapse_mechanism: non-CIVO pathway B (entropy ↑)\n336\t    seed4_eval_105K: 820\n337\t    seed4_collapse: false\n338\t    seed4_nve_105K: 0.75\n339\t    seed4_vs_baseline: -10%\n340\t    cumulative_collapse_rate: 2/4 (50%)\n341\t    collapse_pathway_distribution: 0/2 CIVO (Pathway A), 2/2 non-CIVO (Pathway B)\n342\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 008e_v3 崩溃率维持 ~50%（walker_trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate\n343\t\n344\t    区间 0.25-0.75 的中位值）。4 个独立 seed 中 2 个崩溃（seed 2 和 seed 3），\n345\t\n346\t    2 个健康（seed 1 和 seed 4），与 008d（dt=2 imagination）的 50% 崩溃率\n347\t\n348\t    一致。这强化了 C6 否证：dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。\n349\t\n350\t    所有 008e_v3 崩溃 seed 均展示 Pathway B 动力学（eval-driven, entropy ↑），\n351\t\n352\t    不同于 008d 的 Pathway A（value-driven, entropy ↓），确认 dt=1 imagination\n353\t\n354\t    确实消除了 CIVO 但 Pathway B 的崩溃率填补了空缺。\n355\t\n356\t    '\n357\t  tables:\n358\t  - title: 008e_v3 4-seed collapse summary\n359\t    rows:\n360\t    - seed: 1\n361\t      eval_105K: 870\n362\t      nve_105K: 0.8\n363\t      collapsed: 'No'\n364\t    - seed: 2\n365\t      eval_105K: 137\n366\t      nve_105K: 3.78\n367\t      collapsed: Yes (Pathway B)\n368\t    - seed: 3\n369\t      eval_105K: 145\n370\t      nve_105K: 2.9\n371\t      collapsed: Yes (Pathway B)\n372\t    - seed: 4\n373\t      eval_105K: 820\n374\t      nve_105K: 0.75\n375\t      collapsed: 'No'\n376\t  figures_description:\n377\t  - 008e_v3 4-seed eval 曲线面板，崩溃 seed 用红色标注\n378\t  analysis: '50% 崩溃率 + 纯 Pathway B 崩溃确认：trained dt_emb 的风险是多通路的。\n379\t\n380\t    论文措辞：\"dt=1 imagination eliminates the CIVO feedback loop (Pathway A)\n381\t\n382\t    but does not reduce overall collapse probability; a distinct instability\n383\t\n384\t    pathway (Pathway B) manifests at the same rate.\"\n385\t\n386\t    '\n387\t- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n388\t  plan_id: plan_020\n389\t  description: Cheetah Run dt=1 baseline\n390\t  expected_results:\n391\t    seed0_eval_peak: 850\n392\t    seed0_eval_last10_mean: 820\n393\t    seed1_eval_peak: 810\n394\t    seed1_eval_last10_mean: 780\n395\t    seed2_eval_peak: 830\n396\t    seed2_eval_last10_mean: 800\n397\t    cross_seed_iqm_peak: 830\n398\t    cross_seed_iqm_last10: 800\n399\t    ve_stable_range: 0.65-0.75\n400\t    convergence_step: ~150K\n401\t  result_rationale: 'Cheetah Run 是 DMC 标准环境，DreamerV3 在 500K steps 通常达到 ~800-850。\n402\t\n403\t    010a seed 1 已验证 849.8，额外 seed 预期在 780-830 范围，与 Walker Walk\n404\t\n405\t    baseline 稳定性一致。v/e 收敛至 0.65-0.75 区间提供跨环境 baseline\n406\t\n407\t    calibration。Cheetah 的 obs space 更大（velocity, position），可能\n408\t\n409\t    v/e 收敛略慢于 Walker。\n410\t\n411\t    '\n412\t  tables:\n413\t  - title: Cheetah baseline key checkpoints\n414\t    rows:\n415\t    - metric: eval@105K (IQM)\n416\t      value: ~420\n417\t    - metric: eval@205K (IQM)\n418\t      value: ~650\n419\t    - metric: eval@505K (IQM)\n420\t      value: ~800\n421\t    - metric: v/e stable\n422\t      value: 0.65-0.75 from ~200K\n423\t  figures_description:\n424\t  - Cheetah 3-seed baseline 学习曲线 + IQR 阴影\n425\t  analysis: 'Cheetah baseline 建立后可用于计算 normalized v/e 和 CIVO trigger\n426\t\n427\t    对比。baseline 方差预计与 Walker 相当（seeds 间 ~5-8% 差异）。\n428\t\n429\t    '\n430\t- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n431\t  plan_id: plan_021\n432\t  description: Cheetah Run CIVO trigger 跨环境复制\n433\t  expected_results:\n434\t    seed0_eval_105K: 55\n435\t    seed0_nve_peak: 14.6\n436\t    seed0_collapse: true\n437\t    seed0_collapse_onset: 55000\n438\t    seed1_eval_105K: 120\n439\t    seed1_nve_peak: 9.2\n440\t    seed1_collapse: true\n441\t    seed1_collapse_onset: 65000\n442\t    seed2_eval_105K: 180\n443\t    seed2_nve_peak: 6.8\n444\t    seed2_collapse: false\n445\t    seed2_nve_105K: 2.3\n446\t    seed2_self_corrected: false\n447\t    seed2_trajectory: partial decline, not full collapse\n448\t    cross_seed_collapse_rate: 2/3\n449\t    cross_seed_nve_mean_peak: 10.2\n450\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 cheetah_civo_trigger_nve_peak 在 8-15×。010b seed 0\n451\t\n452\t    已显示 NVE 14.59× 和崩溃确认。额外 seed 预期展示 CIVO 但严重程度\n453\t\n454\t    有差异：seed 1 崩溃较温和（NVE 9.2×, 晚 onset），seed 2 可能仅\n455\t\n456\t    部分退化而非完全崩溃（NVE 6.8×, 位于区间低端），使跨环境叙事\n457\t\n458\t    从 \"replicated\" 降为 \"directionally consistent\"。Cheetah 的奖励\n459\t\n460\t    结构（前进速度主导）与 Walker（步态稳定主导）不同，可能使\n461\t\n462\t    CIVO 的表现形式有差异——Cheetah 的 reward 更连续，value 估计\n463\t\n464\t    可能有更多自校正机会。\n465\t\n466\t    '\n467\t  tables:\n468\t  - title: Cheetah CIVO trigger cross-seed\n469\t    rows:\n470\t    - seed: 0 (010b)\n471\t      nve_peak: 14.59\n472\t      nve_peak_step: 65K\n473\t      eval_105K: 52\n474\t      outcome: COLLAPSE\n475\t    - seed: 1\n476\t      nve_peak: 9.2\n477\t      nve_peak_step: 75K\n478\t      eval_105K: 120\n479\t      outcome: COLLAPSE\n480\t    - seed: 2\n481\t      nve_peak: 6.8\n482\t      nve_peak_step: 55K\n483\t      eval_105K: 180\n484\t      outcome: PARTIAL DECLINE\n485\t  figures_description:\n486\t  - Cheetah CIVO trigger 3-seed NVE 曲线，标注 Walker 的 NVE 范围作为参考\n487\t  analysis: 'CIVO 方向在 Cheetah 确认（3/3 seeds NVE >2×, 2/3 崩溃），但噪声大于 Walker。\n488\t\n489\t    seed 2 的 NVE 6.8× 仍远超健康范围但未触发完全崩溃，可能反映 Cheetah\n490\t\n491\t    reward landscape 的某些自校正属性。论文措辞：\"CIVO mechanism is directionally\n492\t\n493\t    consistent across environments, with quantitative differences in severity.\"\n494\t\n495\t    '\n496\t- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n497\t  plan_id: plan_022\n498\t  description: Cheetah Run 因果控制——关键 borderline 实验\n499\t  expected_results:\n500\t    seed0_eval_105K: 280\n501\t    seed0_nve_peak: 1.45\n502\t    seed0_nve_105K: 0.6\n503\t    seed0_collapse: false\n504\t    seed1_eval_105K: 320\n505\t    seed1_nve_peak: 1.3\n506\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.5\n507\t    seed1_collapse: false\n508\t    seed2_eval_105K: 200\n509\t    seed2_nve_peak: 1.75\n510\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.95\n511\t    seed2_collapse: false\n512\t    cross_seed_nve_all_below_2x: true\n513\t    cross_seed_nve_borderline: seed 2 peak 1.75× (borderline for 1.5× threshold)\n514\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档关键预测：cheetah_control_nve_peak 在 1.3-2.0× 区间。\n515\t\n516\t    这是 median 区别于 best-case 的核心——Walker 008f 的 control nve peak\n517\t\n518\t    仅 1.02-1.26×（远低于 1.5×），但 Cheetah 的 control 更嘈杂。\n519\t\n520\t    seed 2 nve peak 达 1.75×——超过 1.5× 阈值但低于 2.0×——这就是\n521\t\n522\t    那个 \"borderline case\" 削弱 threshold 分类完美性的来源。\n523\t\n524\t    原因在于 Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 可能天然更大（obs space 更丰富），\n525\t\n526\t    即使没有 trained dt_emb，dt=2 transitions 的 reward 预测噪声\n527\t\n528\t    也更严重，导致 v/e 比率在某些 seed 偶然偏高。\n529\t\n530\t    保护方向仍然正确（没有崩溃），但不再是 \"eliminates\" 而是 \"significantly reduces\"。\n531\t\n532\t    '\n533\t  tables:\n534\t  - title: Cheetah control NVE peaks vs Walker control\n535\t    rows:\n536\t    - environment: Walker 008f s0\n537\t      nve_peak: 1.02\n538\t      threshold_violation: 'No'\n539\t    - environment: Walker 008f s1 (009f)\n540\t      nve_peak: 1.05\n541\t      threshold_violation: 'No'\n542\t    - environment: Walker 009c s2\n543\t      nve_peak: 1.26\n544\t      threshold_violation: 'No'\n545\t    - environment: Cheetah s0\n546\t      nve_peak: 1.45\n547\t      threshold_violation: 'No'\n548\t    - environment: Cheetah s1\n549\t      nve_peak: 1.3\n550\t      threshold_violation: 'No'\n551\t    - environment: Cheetah s2\n552\t      nve_peak: 1.75\n553\t      threshold_violation: YES (borderline)\n554\t  figures_description:\n555\t  - Control NVE peak 分布：Walker (3 seeds) vs Cheetah (3 seeds)，标注 1.5× 阈值\n556\t  analysis: 'Cheetah control 的 seed 2 nve peak=1.75× 是 median 档的定义性事件。\n557\t\n558\t    它将 NVE 1.5× 阈值的分类精度从 perfect (6/6) 降至 5/6 ≈ 83%。\n559\t\n560\t    论文需承认：\"The 1.5× NVE threshold achieves ~83% classification accuracy\n561\t\n562\t    across environments; one control seed in Cheetah Run shows borderline\n563\t\n564\t    exceedance (1.75×) without performance collapse, indicating the threshold\n565\t\n566\t    is environment-sensitive.\" 但保护方向成立：所有 control seeds 无崩溃。\n567\t\n568\t    '\n569\t- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n570\t  plan_id: plan_023\n571\t  description: Cheetah Run value growth suppression 复制\n572\t  expected_results:\n573\t    seed0_eval_105K: 450\n574\t    seed0_nve_range: 0.50-0.85\n575\t    seed0_nve_105K: 0.65\n576\t    seed1_eval_105K: 380\n577\t    seed1_nve_range: 0.55-0.90\n578\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.75\n579\t    seed2_eval_105K: 350\n580\t    seed2_nve_range: 0.60-0.95\n581\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.8\n582\t    cross_seed_vs_baseline: -45% to -55%\n583\t    cross_seed_nve_all_below_1x: true\n584\t    recovery_pattern: directionally consistent but weaker than Walker\n585\t  result_rationale: 'Untrained dt_emb 的 value suppression 机制是架构级的，应跨环境保持方向一致。\n586\t\n587\t    但 Cheetah 的绝对恢复程度预期弱于 Walker（Walker 008a@105K=778=85% baseline\n588\t\n589\t    vs Cheetah 预期 ~450=~53% baseline），因为 (1) Cheetah 的 action space\n590\t\n591\t    和 obs space 对 horizon 更敏感，(2) subsample OFF 配置在 Cheetah\n592\t\n593\t    中可能引入更多数据效率损失。nve 保持 <1.0× 确认 suppression 方向正确，\n594\t\n595\t    但效果量差异支持 \"directionally consistent\" 而非 \"replicated\" 的措辞。\n596\t\n597\t    '\n598\t  tables: []\n599\t  figures_description:\n600\t  - Walker 008a vs Cheetah untrained dt_emb 的 normalized v/e 对比\n601\t  analysis: 'C3 在 Cheetah 方向一致但效果量不同——与 median 档 \"environments_with_clean_replication:\n602\t    1-2\"\n603\t\n604\t    一致（Walker 干净，Cheetah 有差异）。论文表述：\"Value growth suppression\n605\t\n606\t    from untrained dt_embedding is directionally consistent across environments\n607\t\n608\t    (nve < 1.0× in all seeds), though recovery magnitude differs with environment\n609\t    complexity.\"\n610\t\n611\t    '\n612\t- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n613\t  plan_id: plan_030\n614\t  description: 量化 RSSM fidelity gap 作为 CIVO 机制基础\n615\t  expected_results:\n616\t    baseline_dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n617\t    baseline_dt2_obs_mse: 27.5\n618\t    baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n619\t    exp008d_dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n620\t    exp008d_dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n621\t    exp008d_obs_gap: 1.3\n622\t    exp008d_dt1_obs_mse_vs_baseline: 3.06×\n623\t    exp008f_dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n624\t    exp008f_dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n625\t    exp008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n626\t    exp008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n627\t    exp008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n628\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM fidelity analysis 已完成。关键发现：008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30×)\n629\t\n630\t    具有误导性——其 dt=1 绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 3×（模型整体已退化）。\n631\t\n632\t    008d 的 reward gap 2.78× 意味着 dt=2 reward 预测系统性偏差，\n633\t\n634\t    这直接导致 critic 在 dt>1 imagination steps 获得错误 value targets。\n635\t\n636\t    008f reward gap 1.01× 表明没有 dt_embedding 时 reward head 无法\n637\t\n638\t    区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward 预测都很差但均匀差），消除了系统性偏差。\n639\t\n640\t    '\n641\t  tables:\n642\t  - title: RSSM Fidelity Table（论文 Table 1）\n643\t    rows:\n644\t    - model: baseline\n645\t      dt1_obs_MSE: 13.49\n646\t      dt2_obs_MSE: 27.5\n647\t      obs_gap: 2.04×\n648\t      dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0102\n649\t      dt2_reward_MAE: 0.0159\n650\t      reward_gap: 1.56×\n651\t    - model: 008d (trained dt_emb)\n652\t      dt1_obs_MSE: 41.31\n653\t      dt2_obs_MSE: 53.67\n654\t      obs_gap: 1.30×\n655\t      dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0568\n656\t      dt2_reward_MAE: 0.1579\n657\t      reward_gap: 2.78×\n658\t    - model: 008f (no dt_emb)\n659\t      dt1_obs_MSE: 8.01\n660\t      dt2_obs_MSE: 22.04\n661\t      obs_gap: 2.75×\n662\t      dt1_reward_MAE: 0.7469\n663\t      dt2_reward_MAE: 0.7526\n664\t      reward_gap: 1.01×\n665\t  figures_description:\n666\t  - 双轴柱状图：绝对误差（左轴）+ gap ratio（右轴），三模型并排\n667\t  analysis: '论文必须同时报告绝对误差和比率，避免 008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30×)\n668\t\n669\t    误导审稿人认为 \"trained dt_emb 改善了 dt=2 预测\"——实际上是 dt=1\n670\t\n671\t    也变差了。核心证据链：trained dt_emb + RSSM fidelity gap → dt=2\n672\t\n673\t    reward 系统性偏差 → critic 在 imagination 中积累错误 value → CIVO。\n674\t\n675\t    '\n676\t- name: Actor entropy analysis\n677\t  plan_id: plan_031\n678\t  description: 健康 vs 崩溃配置的 actor entropy 动力学\n679\t  expected_results:\n680\t    collapsed_008d_s0_entropy_55K: -4.88\n681\t    collapsed_008d_s0_entropy_trend: monotonic decrease → exploitation\n682\t    healthy_008a_s0_entropy_105K: -4.2\n683\t    healthy_008a_s0_entropy_trend: stable after initial decrease\n684\t    pathway_b_008e_v3_s2_entropy_95K: -4.53\n685\t    pathway_b_008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K: -3.83\n686\t    pathway_b_entropy_trend: decrease then INCREASE at collapse\n687\t    baseline_entropy_105K: -5.0\n688\t    baseline_entropy_trend: monotonic decrease then stable ~-5.0\n689\t  result_rationale: 'Entropy 动力学是区分 Pathway A（CIVO）和 Pathway B（non-CIVO）的关键。\n690\t\n691\t    Pathway A（008d）：entropy 持续下降（actor 变得越来越确定，exploitation\n692\t\n693\t    被错误 critic 驱动向错误方向）→ 这是经典 value overestimation 签名。\n694\t\n695\t    Pathway B（008e_v3_s2）：entropy 先正常下降后在崩溃前上升（-5.21→-3.83），\n696\t\n697\t    表明 actor 变得不确定/随机 → 这是 policy destabilization 而非 exploitation。\n698\t\n699\t    健康配置（008a）：entropy 正常下降后稳定，无异常。\n700\t\n701\t    这个分析 0 GPU cost，直接从 metrics.jsonl 提取。\n702\t\n703\t    '\n704\t  tables:\n705\t  - title: Entropy signature by collapse pathway\n706\t    rows:\n707\t    - pathway: Healthy (008a, baseline)\n708\t      entropy_pattern: ↓ then stable\n709\t      late_training_entropy: -4.2 to -5.0\n710\t    - pathway: Pathway A / CIVO (008d)\n711\t      entropy_pattern: ↓↓ monotonic\n712\t      late_training_entropy: -4.88 (exploitation)\n713\t    - pathway: Pathway B / non-CIVO (008e_v3_s2)\n714\t      entropy_pattern: ↓ then ↑\n715\t      late_training_entropy: -3.83 (destabilization)\n716\t  figures_description:\n717\t  - Actor entropy vs training step，4 配置叠加，标注崩溃 onset\n718\t  analysis: 'Entropy 分析为 dual-pathway 论证提供独立支持证据。\n719\t\n720\t    可直接用作论文 Figure（或 appendix figure）区分两种崩溃机制。\n721\t\n722\t    '\n723\t- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n724\t  plan_id: plan_032\n725\t  description: V(s) vs Monte Carlo return 分布对比\n726\t  expected_results:\n727\t    trained_dt_emb_dt2_value_mean: 97.5\n728\t    trained_dt_emb_dt2_mc_return_mean: 55\n729\t    trained_dt_emb_dt2_overestimation_gap: +77%\n730\t    trained_dt_emb_dt1_value_mean: 60\n731\t    trained_dt_emb_dt1_mc_return_mean: 58\n732\t    trained_dt_emb_dt1_gap: +3%\n733\t    untrained_dt_emb_dt2_value_mean: 50\n734\t    untrained_dt_emb_dt2_mc_return_mean: 52\n735\t    untrained_dt_emb_dt2_gap: -4%\n736\t    overlap_coefficient: 0.35\n737\t  result_rationale: '分布分析比标量 v/e 更 informative——能直接展示 trained dt_emb 在 dt=2\n738\t\n739\t    transitions 上的系统性右偏。预期 trained dt_emb 的 dt=2 value 分布\n740\t\n741\t    明显右移（overestimate ~77%），但存在重叠区域（overlap coefficient ~0.35），\n742\t\n743\t    使得分析不如 best-case 干净。dt=1 transitions 在所有配置下大致校准（gap <5%），\n744\t\n745\t    确认过高估仅在 dt>1 触发。untrained dt_emb 的 dt=2 value 轻微低估（-4%），\n746\t\n747\t    与 nve<1.0× 一致。\n748\t\n749\t    '\n750\t  tables: []\n751\t  figures_description:\n752\t  - 核密度图：V(s) vs MC return，训练/未训练 dt_emb × dt=1/dt=2 四面板\n753\t  analysis: '分布分析强化 C2 但因重叠区域存在，证据强度为 moderate 而非 strong。\n754\t\n755\t    论文中可放 appendix。\n756\t\n757\t    '\n758\t- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n759\t  plan_id: plan_033\n760\t  description: 训练过程中 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 向量的相似度演化\n761\t  expected_results:\n762\t    cosine_sim_init: 0.92\n763\t    cosine_sim_25K: 0.65\n764\t    cosine_sim_55K: 0.4\n765\t    cosine_sim_105K: 0.32\n766\t    frozen_cosine_sim: 0.91\n767\t    l2_distance_growth: monotonic increase from 0.3 to 2.1\n768\t  result_rationale: 'Trained dt_emb 的 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 在训练中逐渐分化（cosine similarity\n769\t\n770\t    从 ~0.92 降至 ~0.32），表明网络学会了区分不同 temporal scales。\n771\t\n772\t    这个分化本身是正确的学习行为——问题在于 RSSM 的预测质量不支持\n773\t\n774\t    这种区分精度。在 frozen 配置中 cosine similarity 保持固定（~0.91），\n775\t\n776\t    确认分化是 training-driven。分析有趣但不是核心诊断指标，放 appendix。\n777\t\n778\t    '\n779\t  tables: []\n780\t  figures_description:\n781\t  - Cosine similarity vs training step，叠加 trained/frozen/untrained 配置\n782\t  analysis: 'Supplementary evidence：dt_emb 确实学习了 temporal discrimination，\n783\t\n784\t    但这反而成了问题——越精确的 dt conditioning + 越不精确的 RSSM =\n785\t\n786\t    越严重的 CIVO。放 appendix。\n787\t\n788\t    '\n789\t- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n790\t  plan_id: plan_034\n791\t  description: 0 GPU cost——从已有指标计算不同阈值的分类精度\n792\t  expected_results:\n793\t    threshold_1_3x:\n794\t      accuracy: 0.71\n795\t      false_positives: 2\n796\t      false_negatives: 0\n797\t      note: 009c nve=1.14 和 Cheetah control 部分 seed 的 transient exceedance\n798\t    threshold_1_5x:\n799\t      accuracy: 0.83\n800\t      false_positives: 1\n801\t      false_negatives: 0\n802\t      note: Cheetah control seed 2 nve peak 1.75× 是唯一 borderline case\n803\t    threshold_1_7x:\n804\t      accuracy: 0.92\n805\t      false_positives: 0\n806\t      false_negatives: 0\n807\t      note: all trained seeds exceed; no control seeds exceed\n808\t    threshold_2_0x:\n809\t      accuracy: 0.92\n810\t      false_positives: 0\n811\t      false_negatives: 1\n812\t      note: 009b peak nve=2.05× 仅在 25K (unreliable timepoint)\n813\t    auroc: 0.88\n814\t    optimal_threshold: 1.7\n815\t    recommended_threshold: 1.5\n816\t    recommended_threshold_note: 1.5× 更保守，更适合诊断预警\n817\t    sample_size: ~12 data points (6 trained, 6 control across 2 environments)\n818\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心预测：nve_threshold_classification_accuracy 在 0.75-0.90。\n819\t\n820\t    1.5× 阈值精度 ~83%（6/7 或类似）因 Cheetah control 出现 1 个 borderline case。\n821\t\n822\t    这是 median 与 best-case 的关键差异——best-case 中 Walker 4/4 完美分类\n823\t\n824\t    扩展到跨环境仍然完美。AUROC ~0.88 仍然表明 NVE 是有意义的诊断指标，\n825\t\n826\t    但不再是 \"perfect separator\"。1.7× 阈值实现 0/0 error 但丧失了对\n827\t\n828\t    transient overestimation 的早期预警能力。论文推荐 1.5× 并注明\n829\t\n830\t    环境敏感性。\n831\t\n832\t    '\n833\t  tables:\n834\t  - title: NVE threshold classification performance\n835\t    rows:\n836\t    - threshold: 1.3×\n837\t      accuracy: 71% (5/7)\n838\t      sensitivity: 100%\n839\t      specificity: 67%\n840\t    - threshold: 1.5×\n841\t      accuracy: 83% (5/6)\n842\t      sensitivity: 100%\n843\t      specificity: 83%\n844\t    - threshold: 1.7×\n845\t      accuracy: 92%\n846\t      sensitivity: 100%\n847\t      specificity: 100%\n848\t    - threshold: 2.0×\n849\t      accuracy: 92%\n850\t      sensitivity: 83%\n851\t      specificity: 100%\n852\t  - title: Bootstrap CI for trained vs control Δ NVE\n853\t    rows:\n854\t    - metric: Mean Δ NVE (trained - control)\n855\t      value: '+2.1'\n856\t      ci_95: '[+0.5, +3.2]'\n857\t    - metric: Exceedance probability P(trained > control)\n858\t      value: 90%\n859\t  figures_description:\n860\t  - ROC 曲线：NVE 阈值对 CIVO/non-CIVO 的分类性能\n861\t  - Threshold sensitivity 柱状图：accuracy vs threshold level\n862\t  analysis: 'NVE 1.5× 阈值从 \"perfect separator\" 降级为 \"strong but imperfect diagnostic\"。\n863\t\n864\t    论文措辞需要调整：从 \"4/4 perfect classification\" 到 \"83-92% classification\n865\t\n866\t    accuracy depending on threshold, with one borderline control case in\n867\t\n868\t    Cheetah Run.\" Bootstrap CI lower bound = 0.5（在 median 档的 0.1-0.9 范围内），\n869\t\n870\t    exceedance probability = 90%（在 80-95% 范围内）。\n871\t\n872\t    '\n873\t- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n874\t  plan_id: plan_050\n875\t  description: 第三环境 dt=1 baseline\n876\t  expected_results:\n877\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\n878\t    estimated_baseline_if_run: ~800-860 (DreamerV3 typical)\n879\t    gpu_hours_needed: 15\n880\t    reason_skipped: GPU budget 和 deadline 限制\n881\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设之一：\"Cartpole 实验来不及完成（仅 2 环境）\"。\n882\t\n883\t    CoRL 2026-05-29 deadline 前 GPU 预算不足以完成 3 个 Cartpole 配置\n884\t\n885\t    × 3 seeds。论文以 Walker + Cheetah 两环境提交。\n886\t\n887\t    Reviewers 可能质疑仅 2 环境的泛化性——rebuttal 中承诺提供 Cartpole 数据。\n888\t\n889\t    这是 median 档与 best-case 的第二大差异（best-case 有 3 环境）。\n890\t\n891\t    '\n892\t  tables: []\n893\t  figures_description: []\n894\t  analysis: '论文 limitations 需明确声明：\"Results are demonstrated in two DMC\n895\t\n896\t    locomotion environments (Walker Walk, Cheetah Run). Generalization to\n897\t\n898\t    non-locomotion tasks requires further investigation.\"\n899\t\n900\t    '\n901\t- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n902\t  plan_id: plan_051\n903\t  description: Cartpole CIVO 触发\n904\t  expected_results:\n905\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\n906\t  result_rationale: 依赖 plan_050 baseline，无法在 deadline 前完成。\n907\t  tables: []\n908\t  figures_description: []\n909\t  analysis: 跳过，与 plan_050 相同原因。\n910\t- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n911\t  plan_id: plan_052\n912\t  description: Cartpole 因果控制\n913\t  expected_results:\n914\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\n915\t  result_rationale: 依赖 plan_050 baseline，无法在 deadline 前完成。\n916\t  tables: []\n917\t  figures_description: []\n918\t  analysis: 跳过，与 plan_050 相同原因。\n919\t- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n920\t  plan_id: plan_060\n921\t  description: 基于 RSSM 预测不确定性截断 imagination rollout\n922\t  expected_results:\n923\t    eval_105K: 580\n924\t    vs_baseline: -37%\n925\t    nve_peak: 1.3\n926\t    collapse: false\n927\t    collapse_rate_if_multi_seed: ~25% (1/4 estimate)\n928\t    truncation_rate_avg: 40% of dt=2 steps truncated\n929\t    effective_horizon: ~11 steps (vs H=15 nominal)\n930\t  result_rationale: 'Uncertainty-gated truncation 在 RSSM 预测不确定性超过阈值时截断 imagination。\n931\t\n932\t    Median 档预期：方法在单 seed 试点中表现有希望（无崩溃，nve<1.5×），\n933\t\n934\t    但性能恢复有限（仅 ~63% baseline），因为 truncation 过于激进\n935\t\n936\t    （40% dt=2 步被截断，effective horizon 缩短至 11 步）。\n937\t\n938\t    这说明 truncation 地址了 Pathway A 但可能引入新的性能限制。\n939\t\n940\t    作为 Discussion 中的 future work 方向有价值，但作为独立 contribution 不足。\n941\t\n942\t    '\n943\t  tables: []\n944\t  figures_description:\n945\t  - Truncation rate vs training step 叠加 NVE 曲线\n946\t  analysis: 'Pilot 结果可放 appendix 或 Discussion 的 future work 段。\n947\t\n948\t    不足以作为论文的 mitigation contribution（那需要多 seed + 跨环境验证）。\n949\t\n950\t    '\n951\t- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n952\t  plan_id: plan_040\n953\t  description: 第三环境（非提交优先级）\n954\t  expected_results:\n955\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\n956\t    gpu_hours_needed: 45\n957\t  result_rationale: 'P2 优先级 + 45 GPU hours 需求，在 CoRL deadline 前不可行。\n958\t\n959\t    即使 Cartpole 完成，Hopper 也超出预算。留作后续工作。\n960\t\n961\t    '\n962\t  tables: []\n963\t  figures_description: []\n964\t  analysis: P2 实验，不影响当前提交。\n965\t- name: '008f_s3 borderline NVE (registry: exp_008f_s3_no_dt_embed_walker)'\n966\t  plan_id: registry_only\n967\t  description: Walker Walk 008f 第 3 个 seed——median 档 borderline case\n968\t  expected_results:\n969\t    eval_105K: 250\n970\t    nve_peak: 1.42\n971\t    nve_peak_step: 85000\n972\t    nve_105K: 1.1\n973\t    collapse: false\n974\t    borderline_for_threshold: true\n975\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：''008f_s3 NVE 在 1.2-1.6×（borderline，削弱 threshold\n976\t    完美分类）''。\n977\t\n978\t    seed 0 nve peak=1.02, seed 1 nve peak=1.05, seed 2 (009c) nve peak=1.26。\n979\t\n980\t    seed 3 预期 nve peak ~1.42×，接近但未超过 1.5× 阈值。如果 Cheetah control\n981\t\n982\t    没有提供 borderline case，008f_s3 就是削弱分类精度的数据点。\n983\t\n984\t    即使 nve peak <1.5×，其值（1.42×）足够高以引起审稿人对阈值鲁棒性的质疑。\n985\t\n986\t    '\n987\t  tables: []\n988\t  figures_description: []\n989\t  analysis: '008f_s3 + Cheetah control seed 2 合计提供 1-2 个 borderline cases，\n990\t\n991\t    将 NVE 1.5× 阈值精度从 perfect 降至 ~83%。\n992\t\n993\t    '\n994\t- name: '018v2 Full-SGS 确认分析 (registry: exp_018v2_full_sgs_walker_s1)'\n995\t  plan_id: registry_only\n996\t  description: Full-SGS 消除 CIVO 但不恢复性能\n997\t  expected_results:\n998\t    eval_105K: 448\n999\t    vs_baseline: 49% (448/916)\n1000\t    nve_sustained: 1.05\n1001\t    nve_peak: 1.25\n1002\t    civo_eliminated: true\n1003\t    performance_recovery: partial (49%)\n1004\t    civo_independent_contribution_pp: 28\n1005\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 full_sgs_018v2_nve_sustained 在 0.8-1.3× 区间，\n1006\t\n1007\t    eval 仅恢复到 ~49% baseline。018v2 通过 Full-SGS（移除 observation\n1008\t\n1009\t    decoder 对 dt_emb 的 93% 梯度通路）消除 CIVO（nve ≤ 1.25×），\n1010\t\n1011\t    但性能仅恢复到 448（vs 008d 崩溃至 131，baseline 916）。\n1012\t\n1013\t    CIVO 独立贡献 = 008d@105K baseline ratio - 018v2@105K baseline ratio\n1014\t\n1015\t    = (916-131)/916 - (916-448)/916 ≈ 86% - 51% = 35pp（上界）。\n1016\t\n1017\t    但 median 档承认 inherent multi-dt cost confound：018v2 的 49%\n1018\t\n1019\t    恢复意味着至少 51% 的退化来自 inherent cost（非 CIVO 因素），\n1020\t\n1021\t    使 CIVO 独立贡献的下界为 ~20pp。范围：20-35pp。\n1022\t\n1023\t    Sensitivity analysis 展示不同分解假设下的结果。\n1024\t\n1025\t    '\n1026\t  tables:\n1027\t  - title: CIVO decomposition sensitivity analysis\n1028\t    rows:\n1029\t    - assumption: 'Upper bound: all 008d-018v2 gap = CIVO'\n1030\t      civo_pp: 35\n1031\t      inherent_cost_pp: 51\n1032\t    - assumption: 'Mid estimate: 018v2 inherent cost = 008a inherent cost'\n1033\t      civo_pp: 28\n1034\t      inherent_cost_pp: 58\n1035\t    - assumption: 'Lower bound: inherent cost dominant'\n1036\t      civo_pp: 20\n1037\t      inherent_cost_pp: 66\n1038\t  figures_description:\n1039\t  - 'Stacked bar chart: baseline performance decomposed into retained + inherent cost\n1040\t    + CIVO contribution'\n1041\t  analysis: 'CIVO 独立贡献 20-35pp 是 median 档的核心量化发现。\n1042\t\n1043\t    论文措辞从 \"35pp independent contribution\" 改为 \"20-35pp range,\n1044\t\n1045\t    with the upper bound limited by potential confounding from inherent\n1046\t\n1047\t    multi-dt training cost.\" Sensitivity analysis 是必须的附加材料。'\n1048\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"570624ec-b17e-41f5-bcd8-41108a80bdcf","uuid":"4326f9ae-929b-46c0-aa6e-ab39d0d5b4ef","timestamp":"2026-05-16T18:01:39.774Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T172011/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: \"核心因果方向（trained dt_emb → CIVO → collapse risk）跨 Walker 和 Cheetah\\\n  \\ 成立，\\n但边界不如 best-case 干净。三个关键软化点：\\n(1) NVE 1.5× 阈值分类精度降至 ~83%（6/7），因 008f_s3 或\\\n  \\ Cheetah 控制出现 1 个 borderline case；\\n(2) Cheetah 控制实验 NVE 峰值在 1.3-2.0× 区间（方向正确但不如\\\n  \\ Walker 的 <1.3× 干净），\\n    削弱 \\\"eliminates\\\" 措辞 → 改为 \\\"significantly reduces\\\"；\\n\\\n  (3) CIVO 独立贡献从 \\\"35pp\\\" 降为 \\\"20-35pp range\\\"，需 sensitivity analysis 展示\\n    different\\\n  \\ decomposition assumptions 的影响；\\n(4) 跨环境叙事从 \\\"replicated\\\" 改为 \\\"directionally consistent\\\"\\\n  ；\\n(5) Cartpole 来不及完成，论文只有 2 个环境。\\n仍可投 CoRL，但 rebuttal 需准备额外 seed 或 Cartpole 数据。\\n\"\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 2 额外 seed 复制 CIVO 崩溃\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_009e_eval_105K: 131\n    seed1_009e_nve_peak: 4.12\n    seed1_009e_nve_peak_step: 55000\n    seed1_009e_collapse: true\n    seed1_009e_nve_sustained_above_1_5x: true\n    seed2_009b_eval_105K: 268\n    seed2_009b_nve_peak: 2.05\n    seed2_009b_nve_peak_step: 25000\n    seed2_009b_collapse: false\n    seed2_009b_self_corrected: true\n    seed2_009b_nve_105K: 0.38\n    collapse_rate_across_seeds: 1/2 (50%)\n    nve_exceeds_1_5x_rate: 2/2 (100%)\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 walker_trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate 在 0.25-0.75 区间。\n\n    50% 崩溃率（1/2 独立 seed）落在区间中心。两个 seed 都超过 nve>1.5×，\n\n    确认 trained dt_emb 可靠触发病理性高估，但是否级联为崩溃取决于\n\n    早期训练随机性（初始化 + 数据采样顺序）。seed 1 的 nve 在 35K+ 连续\n\n    3 个 checkpoint 维持 >1.5×（1.71→2.09→4.12），锁定正反馈环；\n\n    seed 2 的 nve 在 45K 短暂达 1.62× 后立即回落至 1.41×，自校正力\n\n    在反馈环锁定前占据主导。这与 Henderson et al. (2018) 关于 RL\n\n    结果高方差的文献一致——崩溃是随机的，但诊断标记（nve>1.5×）是确定性的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008d cross-seed NVE trajectory (35K+)\n    rows:\n    - seed: 0 (008d)\n      nve_35K: 1.71\n      nve_45K: 2.09\n      nve_55K: 4.12\n      outcome: COLLAPSE\n    - seed: 1 (009e)\n      nve_35K: 1.71\n      nve_45K: 2.09\n      nve_55K: 4.12\n      outcome: COLLAPSE\n    - seed: 2 (009b)\n      nve_25K: 2.05\n      nve_45K: 1.62\n      nve_55K: 1.41\n      nve_105K: 0.38\n      outcome: SELF-CORRECTED\n  figures_description:\n  - NVE 时间序列（3 seeds 叠加），标注 1.5× 阈值线和崩溃/自校正区域\n  analysis: 'C2 因果方向在 Walker Walk 跨 seed 得到确认：所有 trained dt_emb seed 均触发\n\n    nve>1.5×（3/3 counting seed 0），崩溃率 ~50%（2/3 counting seed 0）。\n\n    seed 0 和 seed 1 共享 seed=1 故只计 1 个独立观测，独立崩溃率 1/2。\n\n    关键洞察：nve>1.5× 是必要但非充分的崩溃条件——temporal persistence 是第二道门。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 2 额外 seed 复制因果控制稳定性\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_009f_eval_105K: 380\n    seed1_009f_nve_peak: 1.05\n    seed1_009f_nve_105K: 0.35\n    seed1_009f_collapse: false\n    seed1_009f_trajectory: zigzag recovery, 173→375→290→380\n    seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148\n    seed2_009c_nve_peak: 1.26\n    seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n    seed2_009c_collapse: false\n    seed2_009c_trajectory: peak 359@75K then monotonic decline\n    cross_seed_nve_below_1_5x: 2/2\n    cross_seed_eval_variance: high (148-503 at 105K across 3 seeds)\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档中 008f 的保护方向成立（nve 均未超 1.5×），但跨 seed 一致性差。\n\n    seed 2 (009c) 出现 75K 后持续下降而非 seed 0 的 zigzag 恢复，nve 从 0.33@75K\n\n    上升至 1.14@105K，逼近但未突破 1.5× 阈值。seed 1 (009f) 的恢复比 seed 0\n\n    弱但保持稳定。高 eval 方差（3 seeds: 503, 380, 148）说明 dt_embed_dim=0\n\n    虽然阻断 CIVO 但引入了自身的不稳定性（reward_MAE = 0.747, baseline 75×），\n\n    并非推荐方案。这支持 paper 中 008f 定位为因果控制而非实用缓解的叙事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008f cross-seed summary at 105K\n    rows:\n    - seed: 0 (008f)\n      eval_105K: 503\n      nve_105K: 0.3\n      nve_peak: 1.02\n      trend: zigzag recovery ↑\n    - seed: 1 (009f)\n      eval_105K: 380\n      nve_105K: 0.35\n      nve_peak: 1.05\n      trend: moderate recovery\n    - seed: 2 (009c)\n      eval_105K: 148\n      nve_105K: 1.14\n      nve_peak: 1.26\n      trend: decline after 75K\n  figures_description:\n  - 008f 3-seed eval 学习曲线 + 阴影 IQR，对比 008d 3-seed\n  analysis: '008f 因果控制结论成立但不如 best-case 干净。所有 seed nve<1.5×（3/3），\n\n    但 009c nve=1.14@105K 且仍在上升，若延长至 200K 可能接近阈值。\n\n    关键：009c 的 performance decline 不是 CIVO（value 没有爆炸），\n\n    而是 reward prediction 噪声导致的 critic 质量退化——这正是 008f\n\n    去掉 dt_embedding 的副作用。论文中需明确区分因果控制（成功）\n\n    和性能恢复（不成功）。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: 2 额外 seed 复制 value growth suppression\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 680\n    seed1_nve_range: 0.55-0.85\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.65\n    seed1_recovery_pattern: single V-recovery, less pronounced than seed 0\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed2_eval_105K: 550\n    seed2_nve_range: 0.60-0.95\n    seed2_nve_105K: 0.78\n    seed2_recovery_pattern: gradual rise without clear V-shape\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    cross_seed_mean_eval_105K: 669\n    cross_seed_vs_baseline_105K: -27%\n    cross_seed_nve_all_below_1x: partial — seed 2 briefly touches 0.95x\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档中 008a 的 value suppression 方向一致但效果量跨 seed 有差异。\n\n    seed 0 达到 778@105K（85% baseline），但额外 seed 预期稍弱（680, 550），\n\n    因为 zigzag recovery 的恢复幅度依赖训练随机性。seed 2 可能更慢恢复，\n\n    105K 时仅达 ~60% baseline。关键指标 nve 在所有 seed 保持 <1.0×，\n\n    确认 value growth suppression 是结构性的（untrained dt_emb 阻止 value\n\n    利用 dt 信息），但绝对性能差异大于 seed 0 报告值。\n\n    论文中报告 IQM 时需包含这个方差。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008a cross-seed V-recovery comparison\n    rows:\n    - seed: 0\n      eval_55K: 488\n      eval_75K: 470\n      eval_105K: 778\n      nve_105K: 0.59\n      recovery_cycles: 2\n    - seed: 1\n      eval_55K: 420\n      eval_75K: 520\n      eval_105K: 680\n      nve_105K: 0.65\n      recovery_cycles: 1\n    - seed: 2\n      eval_55K: 350\n      eval_75K: 400\n      eval_105K: 550\n      nve_105K: 0.78\n      recovery_cycles: 0\n  figures_description:\n  - 008a 3-seed eval 曲线对比 baseline 3-seed，展示 value suppression 效果的跨 seed 方差\n  analysis: 'C3 方向一致但 seed 间效果量差异显著（778 vs 550 at 105K）。\n\n    IQM = ~669，约 73% baseline。论文措辞应为 \"untrained dt_emb provides\n\n    directionally consistent value suppression (nve 0.55-0.95× across all seeds)\n\n    and prevents catastrophic collapse, but absolute recovery varies substantially\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (dt=1 imagination) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: 多 seed 验证 dt=1 imagination 作为缓解策略\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 870\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.8\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed1_vs_baseline: -5%\n    seed2_eval_105K: 137\n    seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n    seed2_collapse: true\n    seed2_collapse_onset: 95000\n    seed2_collapse_mechanism: non-CIVO (eval-driven, entropy ↑)\n    seed2_actor_entropy_at_collapse: -3.83\n    collapse_rate: 1/2 (50%)\n    gate_dt_mean_both_seeds: 1.0\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档中 C6 部分否证是核心发现之一。seed 1 健康（95% baseline），\n\n    seed 2 崩溃但机制与经典 CIVO 不同：008d 崩溃时 value 爆炸 + entropy ↓\n\n    （actor exploit 错误 critic），008e_v3_s2 崩溃时 eval 先跌 + entropy ↑\n\n    （policy destabilization）。gate_dt=1.0 贯穿始终证明崩溃并非 dt>1\n\n    imagination 引起。009a baseline s2 在同期完全稳定（618→596→837），\n\n    排除 seed 2 本身脆弱的假说。这意味着 trained dt_embedding 的风险\n\n    不仅仅是 CIVO：即使 imagination 全部用 dt=1，训练数据中的 dt>1\n\n    transitions + trained dt_emb 就足以创造另一条脆弱性通路（Pathway B）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008e_v3 collapse pathway comparison\n    rows:\n    - feature: value 变化\n      008d_s1_CIVO: 爆炸 (+130%)\n      008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: 温和 (+13%→-12%)\n    - feature: eval 变化\n      008d_s1_CIVO: 后跌 (-43%)\n      008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: 先跌 (-81%)\n    - feature: nve 驱动\n      008d_s1_CIVO: value 分子驱动\n      008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: eval 分母驱动\n    - feature: actor_entropy\n      008d_s1_CIVO: ↓ (-3.47→-4.88)\n      008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: ↑ (-5.21→-3.83)\n    - feature: 机制\n      008d_s1_CIVO: critic overestimate → actor exploit\n      008e_v3_s2_PathwayB: eval crash → value 滞后\n  figures_description:\n  - 008e_v3 seed 1 vs seed 2 的 eval/value/entropy 三指标对比面板\n  - Pathway A (CIVO) vs Pathway B (non-CIVO) 的因果图\n  analysis: 'C6 从 \"dt=1 imagination = mitigation\" 修正为 \"trained dt_embedding creates\n\n    vulnerability through multiple pathways\"。dt=1 消除 Pathway A（CIVO）\n\n    但不消除 Pathway B（policy instability）。崩溃率 50% 与 008d 相同，\n\n    意味着 dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。论文 Discussion 中应将此\n\n    作为关键发现：根本脆弱性在于 trained dt_embedding 本身，不在 imagination dt。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: Frozen dt_embedding（requires_grad=False）诊断 training 是否为 CIVO 必要条件\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K: 204\n    nve_range: 0.39-0.47\n    nve_105K: 0.42\n    collapse: false\n    civo_detected: false\n    actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n    actor_entropy_105K: -4.855\n    gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n    gradient_starvation_detected: true\n    eval_trajectory: volatile 80-238, no convergence\n  result_rationale: 'Frozen dt_emb 提供随机固定的 temporal conditioning，RSSM 无法通过\n\n    梯度学习利用它。结果：(1) nve 远低于 1.0×（critic 系统性低估而非高估），\n\n    不触发 CIVO；(2) actor_loss→0 表明梯度饥饿——frozen random embeddings\n\n    在 state space 中引入不可学习的噪声维度，actor 无法从 critic\n\n    获得有意义的策略梯度；(3) 性能极不稳定（80-238），无法收敛。\n\n    与 008d（trained dt_emb, 崩溃）对比确认：dt_emb 的 TRAINING\n\n    是 CIVO 的必要条件。frozen dt_emb 不触发 CIVO 但也不提供任何\n\n    有用信息，造成学习退化。这完善了 2×2 消融矩阵：\n\n    trained+exposed=CIVO, trained+unexposed=value suppression,\n\n    frozen=gradient starvation, absent=reward degradation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: dt_emb 状态 × CIVO outcome 消融矩阵\n    rows:\n    - dt_emb: trained + exposed (008d)\n      nve_regime: '>1.5× (CIVO)'\n      eval_105K: 131\n      mechanism: value explosion\n    - dt_emb: trained + unexposed (008a)\n      nve_regime: <1.0× (suppressed)\n      eval_105K: 778\n      mechanism: value growth suppression\n    - dt_emb: frozen random (015b)\n      nve_regime: <0.5× (starved)\n      eval_105K: 204\n      mechanism: gradient starvation\n    - dt_emb: absent (008f)\n      nve_regime: <1.0× (stable)\n      eval_105K: 503\n      mechanism: reward degradation\n  figures_description:\n  - 2×2 消融矩阵热力图：行=dt_emb state, 列=key metric (nve, eval)\n  analysis: '015b 确认 dt_emb training 是 CIVO 的必要条件。frozen random embedding\n\n    创造了一种独特的失败模式（gradient starvation），与 CIVO（value explosion）\n\n    和 reward degradation（008f）都不同。论文中可在 Table 形式呈现完整消融矩阵。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (3-4)\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: 缩窄 008e_v3 崩溃概率估计\n  expected_results:\n    seed3_eval_105K: 145\n    seed3_collapse: true\n    seed3_collapse_onset: 90000\n    seed3_nve_105K: 2.9\n    seed3_collapse_mechanism: non-CIVO pathway B (entropy ↑)\n    seed4_eval_105K: 820\n    seed4_collapse: false\n    seed4_nve_105K: 0.75\n    seed4_vs_baseline: -10%\n    cumulative_collapse_rate: 2/4 (50%)\n    collapse_pathway_distribution: 0/2 CIVO (Pathway A), 2/2 non-CIVO (Pathway B)\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 008e_v3 崩溃率维持 ~50%（walker_trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate\n\n    区间 0.25-0.75 的中位值）。4 个独立 seed 中 2 个崩溃（seed 2 和 seed 3），\n\n    2 个健康（seed 1 和 seed 4），与 008d（dt=2 imagination）的 50% 崩溃率\n\n    一致。这强化了 C6 否证：dt=1 imagination 未降低崩溃概率。\n\n    所有 008e_v3 崩溃 seed 均展示 Pathway B 动力学（eval-driven, entropy ↑），\n\n    不同于 008d 的 Pathway A（value-driven, entropy ↓），确认 dt=1 imagination\n\n    确实消除了 CIVO 但 Pathway B 的崩溃率填补了空缺。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 008e_v3 4-seed collapse summary\n    rows:\n    - seed: 1\n      eval_105K: 870\n      nve_105K: 0.8\n      collapsed: 'No'\n    - seed: 2\n      eval_105K: 137\n      nve_105K: 3.78\n      collapsed: Yes (Pathway B)\n    - seed: 3\n      eval_105K: 145\n      nve_105K: 2.9\n      collapsed: Yes (Pathway B)\n    - seed: 4\n      eval_105K: 820\n      nve_105K: 0.75\n      collapsed: 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 008e_v3 4-seed eval 曲线面板，崩溃 seed 用红色标注\n  analysis: '50% 崩溃率 + 纯 Pathway B 崩溃确认：trained dt_emb 的风险是多通路的。\n\n    论文措辞：\"dt=1 imagination eliminates the CIVO feedback loop (Pathway A)\n\n    but does not reduce overall collapse probability; a distinct instability\n\n    pathway (Pathway B) manifests at the same rate.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: Cheetah Run dt=1 baseline\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_peak: 850\n    seed0_eval_last10_mean: 820\n    seed1_eval_peak: 810\n    seed1_eval_last10_mean: 780\n    seed2_eval_peak: 830\n    seed2_eval_last10_mean: 800\n    cross_seed_iqm_peak: 830\n    cross_seed_iqm_last10: 800\n    ve_stable_range: 0.65-0.75\n    convergence_step: ~150K\n  result_rationale: 'Cheetah Run 是 DMC 标准环境，DreamerV3 在 500K steps 通常达到 ~800-850。\n\n    010a seed 1 已验证 849.8，额外 seed 预期在 780-830 范围，与 Walker Walk\n\n    baseline 稳定性一致。v/e 收敛至 0.65-0.75 区间提供跨环境 baseline\n\n    calibration。Cheetah 的 obs space 更大（velocity, position），可能\n\n    v/e 收敛略慢于 Walker。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah baseline key checkpoints\n    rows:\n    - metric: eval@105K (IQM)\n      value: ~420\n    - metric: eval@205K (IQM)\n      value: ~650\n    - metric: eval@505K (IQM)\n      value: ~800\n    - metric: v/e stable\n      value: 0.65-0.75 from ~200K\n  figures_description:\n  - Cheetah 3-seed baseline 学习曲线 + IQR 阴影\n  analysis: 'Cheetah baseline 建立后可用于计算 normalized v/e 和 CIVO trigger\n\n    对比。baseline 方差预计与 Walker 相当（seeds 间 ~5-8% 差异）。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: Cheetah Run CIVO trigger 跨环境复制\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_105K: 55\n    seed0_nve_peak: 14.6\n    seed0_collapse: true\n    seed0_collapse_onset: 55000\n    seed1_eval_105K: 120\n    seed1_nve_peak: 9.2\n    seed1_collapse: true\n    seed1_collapse_onset: 65000\n    seed2_eval_105K: 180\n    seed2_nve_peak: 6.8\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed2_nve_105K: 2.3\n    seed2_self_corrected: false\n    seed2_trajectory: partial decline, not full collapse\n    cross_seed_collapse_rate: 2/3\n    cross_seed_nve_mean_peak: 10.2\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 cheetah_civo_trigger_nve_peak 在 8-15×。010b seed 0\n\n    已显示 NVE 14.59× 和崩溃确认。额外 seed 预期展示 CIVO 但严重程度\n\n    有差异：seed 1 崩溃较温和（NVE 9.2×, 晚 onset），seed 2 可能仅\n\n    部分退化而非完全崩溃（NVE 6.8×, 位于区间低端），使跨环境叙事\n\n    从 \"replicated\" 降为 \"directionally consistent\"。Cheetah 的奖励\n\n    结构（前进速度主导）与 Walker（步态稳定主导）不同，可能使\n\n    CIVO 的表现形式有差异——Cheetah 的 reward 更连续，value 估计\n\n    可能有更多自校正机会。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah CIVO trigger cross-seed\n    rows:\n    - seed: 0 (010b)\n      nve_peak: 14.59\n      nve_peak_step: 65K\n      eval_105K: 52\n      outcome: COLLAPSE\n    - seed: 1\n      nve_peak: 9.2\n      nve_peak_step: 75K\n      eval_105K: 120\n      outcome: COLLAPSE\n    - seed: 2\n      nve_peak: 6.8\n      nve_peak_step: 55K\n      eval_105K: 180\n      outcome: PARTIAL DECLINE\n  figures_description:\n  - Cheetah CIVO trigger 3-seed NVE 曲线，标注 Walker 的 NVE 范围作为参考\n  analysis: 'CIVO 方向在 Cheetah 确认（3/3 seeds NVE >2×, 2/3 崩溃），但噪声大于 Walker。\n\n    seed 2 的 NVE 6.8× 仍远超健康范围但未触发完全崩溃，可能反映 Cheetah\n\n    reward landscape 的某些自校正属性。论文措辞：\"CIVO mechanism is directionally\n\n    consistent across environments, with quantitative differences in severity.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: Cheetah Run 因果控制——关键 borderline 实验\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_105K: 280\n    seed0_nve_peak: 1.45\n    seed0_nve_105K: 0.6\n    seed0_collapse: false\n    seed1_eval_105K: 320\n    seed1_nve_peak: 1.3\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.5\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed2_eval_105K: 200\n    seed2_nve_peak: 1.75\n    seed2_nve_105K: 0.95\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    cross_seed_nve_all_below_2x: true\n    cross_seed_nve_borderline: seed 2 peak 1.75× (borderline for 1.5× threshold)\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档关键预测：cheetah_control_nve_peak 在 1.3-2.0× 区间。\n\n    这是 median 区别于 best-case 的核心——Walker 008f 的 control nve peak\n\n    仅 1.02-1.26×（远低于 1.5×），但 Cheetah 的 control 更嘈杂。\n\n    seed 2 nve peak 达 1.75×——超过 1.5× 阈值但低于 2.0×——这就是\n\n    那个 \"borderline case\" 削弱 threshold 分类完美性的来源。\n\n    原因在于 Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 可能天然更大（obs space 更丰富），\n\n    即使没有 trained dt_emb，dt=2 transitions 的 reward 预测噪声\n\n    也更严重，导致 v/e 比率在某些 seed 偶然偏高。\n\n    保护方向仍然正确（没有崩溃），但不再是 \"eliminates\" 而是 \"significantly reduces\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah control NVE peaks vs Walker control\n    rows:\n    - environment: Walker 008f s0\n      nve_peak: 1.02\n      threshold_violation: 'No'\n    - environment: Walker 008f s1 (009f)\n      nve_peak: 1.05\n      threshold_violation: 'No'\n    - environment: Walker 009c s2\n      nve_peak: 1.26\n      threshold_violation: 'No'\n    - environment: Cheetah s0\n      nve_peak: 1.45\n      threshold_violation: 'No'\n    - environment: Cheetah s1\n      nve_peak: 1.3\n      threshold_violation: 'No'\n    - environment: Cheetah s2\n      nve_peak: 1.75\n      threshold_violation: YES (borderline)\n  figures_description:\n  - Control NVE peak 分布：Walker (3 seeds) vs Cheetah (3 seeds)，标注 1.5× 阈值\n  analysis: 'Cheetah control 的 seed 2 nve peak=1.75× 是 median 档的定义性事件。\n\n    它将 NVE 1.5× 阈值的分类精度从 perfect (6/6) 降至 5/6 ≈ 83%。\n\n    论文需承认：\"The 1.5× NVE threshold achieves ~83% classification accuracy\n\n    across environments; one control seed in Cheetah Run shows borderline\n\n    exceedance (1.75×) without performance collapse, indicating the threshold\n\n    is environment-sensitive.\" 但保护方向成立：所有 control seeds 无崩溃。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_023\n  description: Cheetah Run value growth suppression 复制\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_105K: 450\n    seed0_nve_range: 0.50-0.85\n    seed0_nve_105K: 0.65\n    seed1_eval_105K: 380\n    seed1_nve_range: 0.55-0.90\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.75\n    seed2_eval_105K: 350\n    seed2_nve_range: 0.60-0.95\n    seed2_nve_105K: 0.8\n    cross_seed_vs_baseline: -45% to -55%\n    cross_seed_nve_all_below_1x: true\n    recovery_pattern: directionally consistent but weaker than Walker\n  result_rationale: 'Untrained dt_emb 的 value suppression 机制是架构级的，应跨环境保持方向一致。\n\n    但 Cheetah 的绝对恢复程度预期弱于 Walker（Walker 008a@105K=778=85% baseline\n\n    vs Cheetah 预期 ~450=~53% baseline），因为 (1) Cheetah 的 action space\n\n    和 obs space 对 horizon 更敏感，(2) subsample OFF 配置在 Cheetah\n\n    中可能引入更多数据效率损失。nve 保持 <1.0× 确认 suppression 方向正确，\n\n    但效果量差异支持 \"directionally consistent\" 而非 \"replicated\" 的措辞。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Walker 008a vs Cheetah untrained dt_emb 的 normalized v/e 对比\n  analysis: 'C3 在 Cheetah 方向一致但效果量不同——与 median 档 \"environments_with_clean_replication:\n    1-2\"\n\n    一致（Walker 干净，Cheetah 有差异）。论文表述：\"Value growth suppression\n\n    from untrained dt_embedding is directionally consistent across environments\n\n    (nve < 1.0× in all seeds), though recovery magnitude differs with environment\n    complexity.\"\n\n    '\n- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: 量化 RSSM fidelity gap 作为 CIVO 机制基础\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_dt1_obs_mse: 13.49\n    baseline_dt2_obs_mse: 27.5\n    baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n    exp008d_dt1_obs_mse: 41.31\n    exp008d_dt2_obs_mse: 53.67\n    exp008d_obs_gap: 1.3\n    exp008d_dt1_obs_mse_vs_baseline: 3.06×\n    exp008f_dt1_obs_mse: 8.01\n    exp008f_dt2_obs_mse: 22.04\n    exp008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n    exp008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n    exp008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n  result_rationale: 'RSSM fidelity analysis 已完成。关键发现：008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30×)\n\n    具有误导性——其 dt=1 绝对误差 41.31 已是 baseline 3×（模型整体已退化）。\n\n    008d 的 reward gap 2.78× 意味着 dt=2 reward 预测系统性偏差，\n\n    这直接导致 critic 在 dt>1 imagination steps 获得错误 value targets。\n\n    008f reward gap 1.01× 表明没有 dt_embedding 时 reward head 无法\n\n    区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward 预测都很差但均匀差），消除了系统性偏差。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: RSSM Fidelity Table（论文 Table 1）\n    rows:\n    - model: baseline\n      dt1_obs_MSE: 13.49\n      dt2_obs_MSE: 27.5\n      obs_gap: 2.04×\n      dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0102\n      dt2_reward_MAE: 0.0159\n      reward_gap: 1.56×\n    - model: 008d (trained dt_emb)\n      dt1_obs_MSE: 41.31\n      dt2_obs_MSE: 53.67\n      obs_gap: 1.30×\n      dt1_reward_MAE: 0.0568\n      dt2_reward_MAE: 0.1579\n      reward_gap: 2.78×\n    - model: 008f (no dt_emb)\n      dt1_obs_MSE: 8.01\n      dt2_obs_MSE: 22.04\n      obs_gap: 2.75×\n      dt1_reward_MAE: 0.7469\n      dt2_reward_MAE: 0.7526\n      reward_gap: 1.01×\n  figures_description:\n  - 双轴柱状图：绝对误差（左轴）+ gap ratio（右轴），三模型并排\n  analysis: '论文必须同时报告绝对误差和比率，避免 008d 的低 obs gap ratio (1.30×)\n\n    误导审稿人认为 \"trained dt_emb 改善了 dt=2 预测\"——实际上是 dt=1\n\n    也变差了。核心证据链：trained dt_emb + RSSM fidelity gap → dt=2\n\n    reward 系统性偏差 → critic 在 imagination 中积累错误 value → CIVO。\n\n    '\n- name: Actor entropy analysis\n  plan_id: plan_031\n  description: 健康 vs 崩溃配置的 actor entropy 动力学\n  expected_results:\n    collapsed_008d_s0_entropy_55K: -4.88\n    collapsed_008d_s0_entropy_trend: monotonic decrease → exploitation\n    healthy_008a_s0_entropy_105K: -4.2\n    healthy_008a_s0_entropy_trend: stable after initial decrease\n    pathway_b_008e_v3_s2_entropy_95K: -4.53\n    pathway_b_008e_v3_s2_entropy_105K: -3.83\n    pathway_b_entropy_trend: decrease then INCREASE at collapse\n    baseline_entropy_105K: -5.0\n    baseline_entropy_trend: monotonic decrease then stable ~-5.0\n  result_rationale: 'Entropy 动力学是区分 Pathway A（CIVO）和 Pathway B（non-CIVO）的关键。\n\n    Pathway A（008d）：entropy 持续下降（actor 变得越来越确定，exploitation\n\n    被错误 critic 驱动向错误方向）→ 这是经典 value overestimation 签名。\n\n    Pathway B（008e_v3_s2）：entropy 先正常下降后在崩溃前上升（-5.21→-3.83），\n\n    表明 actor 变得不确定/随机 → 这是 policy destabilization 而非 exploitation。\n\n    健康配置（008a）：entropy 正常下降后稳定，无异常。\n\n    这个分析 0 GPU cost，直接从 metrics.jsonl 提取。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Entropy signature by collapse pathway\n    rows:\n    - pathway: Healthy (008a, baseline)\n      entropy_pattern: ↓ then stable\n      late_training_entropy: -4.2 to -5.0\n    - pathway: Pathway A / CIVO (008d)\n      entropy_pattern: ↓↓ monotonic\n      late_training_entropy: -4.88 (exploitation)\n    - pathway: Pathway B / non-CIVO (008e_v3_s2)\n      entropy_pattern: ↓ then ↑\n      late_training_entropy: -3.83 (destabilization)\n  figures_description:\n  - Actor entropy vs training step，4 配置叠加，标注崩溃 onset\n  analysis: 'Entropy 分析为 dual-pathway 论证提供独立支持证据。\n\n    可直接用作论文 Figure（或 appendix figure）区分两种崩溃机制。\n\n    '\n- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n  plan_id: plan_032\n  description: V(s) vs Monte Carlo return 分布对比\n  expected_results:\n    trained_dt_emb_dt2_value_mean: 97.5\n    trained_dt_emb_dt2_mc_return_mean: 55\n    trained_dt_emb_dt2_overestimation_gap: +77%\n    trained_dt_emb_dt1_value_mean: 60\n    trained_dt_emb_dt1_mc_return_mean: 58\n    trained_dt_emb_dt1_gap: +3%\n    untrained_dt_emb_dt2_value_mean: 50\n    untrained_dt_emb_dt2_mc_return_mean: 52\n    untrained_dt_emb_dt2_gap: -4%\n    overlap_coefficient: 0.35\n  result_rationale: '分布分析比标量 v/e 更 informative——能直接展示 trained dt_emb 在 dt=2\n\n    transitions 上的系统性右偏。预期 trained dt_emb 的 dt=2 value 分布\n\n    明显右移（overestimate ~77%），但存在重叠区域（overlap coefficient ~0.35），\n\n    使得分析不如 best-case 干净。dt=1 transitions 在所有配置下大致校准（gap <5%），\n\n    确认过高估仅在 dt>1 触发。untrained dt_emb 的 dt=2 value 轻微低估（-4%），\n\n    与 nve<1.0× 一致。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 核密度图：V(s) vs MC return，训练/未训练 dt_emb × dt=1/dt=2 四面板\n  analysis: '分布分析强化 C2 但因重叠区域存在，证据强度为 moderate 而非 strong。\n\n    论文中可放 appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_033\n  description: 训练过程中 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 向量的相似度演化\n  expected_results:\n    cosine_sim_init: 0.92\n    cosine_sim_25K: 0.65\n    cosine_sim_55K: 0.4\n    cosine_sim_105K: 0.32\n    frozen_cosine_sim: 0.91\n    l2_distance_growth: monotonic increase from 0.3 to 2.1\n  result_rationale: 'Trained dt_emb 的 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 在训练中逐渐分化（cosine similarity\n\n    从 ~0.92 降至 ~0.32），表明网络学会了区分不同 temporal scales。\n\n    这个分化本身是正确的学习行为——问题在于 RSSM 的预测质量不支持\n\n    这种区分精度。在 frozen 配置中 cosine similarity 保持固定（~0.91），\n\n    确认分化是 training-driven。分析有趣但不是核心诊断指标，放 appendix。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Cosine similarity vs training step，叠加 trained/frozen/untrained 配置\n  analysis: 'Supplementary evidence：dt_emb 确实学习了 temporal discrimination，\n\n    但这反而成了问题——越精确的 dt conditioning + 越不精确的 RSSM =\n\n    越严重的 CIVO。放 appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_034\n  description: 0 GPU cost——从已有指标计算不同阈值的分类精度\n  expected_results:\n    threshold_1_3x:\n      accuracy: 0.71\n      false_positives: 2\n      false_negatives: 0\n      note: 009c nve=1.14 和 Cheetah control 部分 seed 的 transient exceedance\n    threshold_1_5x:\n      accuracy: 0.83\n      false_positives: 1\n      false_negatives: 0\n      note: Cheetah control seed 2 nve peak 1.75× 是唯一 borderline case\n    threshold_1_7x:\n      accuracy: 0.92\n      false_positives: 0\n      false_negatives: 0\n      note: all trained seeds exceed; no control seeds exceed\n    threshold_2_0x:\n      accuracy: 0.92\n      false_positives: 0\n      false_negatives: 1\n      note: 009b peak nve=2.05× 仅在 25K (unreliable timepoint)\n    auroc: 0.88\n    optimal_threshold: 1.7\n    recommended_threshold: 1.5\n    recommended_threshold_note: 1.5× 更保守，更适合诊断预警\n    sample_size: ~12 data points (6 trained, 6 control across 2 environments)\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心预测：nve_threshold_classification_accuracy 在 0.75-0.90。\n\n    1.5× 阈值精度 ~83%（6/7 或类似）因 Cheetah control 出现 1 个 borderline case。\n\n    这是 median 与 best-case 的关键差异——best-case 中 Walker 4/4 完美分类\n\n    扩展到跨环境仍然完美。AUROC ~0.88 仍然表明 NVE 是有意义的诊断指标，\n\n    但不再是 \"perfect separator\"。1.7× 阈值实现 0/0 error 但丧失了对\n\n    transient overestimation 的早期预警能力。论文推荐 1.5× 并注明\n\n    环境敏感性。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: NVE threshold classification performance\n    rows:\n    - threshold: 1.3×\n      accuracy: 71% (5/7)\n      sensitivity: 100%\n      specificity: 67%\n    - threshold: 1.5×\n      accuracy: 83% (5/6)\n      sensitivity: 100%\n      specificity: 83%\n    - threshold: 1.7×\n      accuracy: 92%\n      sensitivity: 100%\n      specificity: 100%\n    - threshold: 2.0×\n      accuracy: 92%\n      sensitivity: 83%\n      specificity: 100%\n  - title: Bootstrap CI for trained vs control Δ NVE\n    rows:\n    - metric: Mean Δ NVE (trained - control)\n      value: '+2.1'\n      ci_95: '[+0.5, +3.2]'\n    - metric: Exceedance probability P(trained > control)\n      value: 90%\n  figures_description:\n  - ROC 曲线：NVE 阈值对 CIVO/non-CIVO 的分类性能\n  - Threshold sensitivity 柱状图：accuracy vs threshold level\n  analysis: 'NVE 1.5× 阈值从 \"perfect separator\" 降级为 \"strong but imperfect diagnostic\"。\n\n    论文措辞需要调整：从 \"4/4 perfect classification\" 到 \"83-92% classification\n\n    accuracy depending on threshold, with one borderline control case in\n\n    Cheetah Run.\" Bootstrap CI lower bound = 0.5（在 median 档的 0.1-0.9 范围内），\n\n    exceedance probability = 90%（在 80-95% 范围内）。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_050\n  description: 第三环境 dt=1 baseline\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\n    estimated_baseline_if_run: ~800-860 (DreamerV3 typical)\n    gpu_hours_needed: 15\n    reason_skipped: GPU budget 和 deadline 限制\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设之一：\"Cartpole 实验来不及完成（仅 2 环境）\"。\n\n    CoRL 2026-05-29 deadline 前 GPU 预算不足以完成 3 个 Cartpole 配置\n\n    × 3 seeds。论文以 Walker + Cheetah 两环境提交。\n\n    Reviewers 可能质疑仅 2 环境的泛化性——rebuttal 中承诺提供 Cartpole 数据。\n\n    这是 median 档与 best-case 的第二大差异（best-case 有 3 环境）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '论文 limitations 需明确声明：\"Results are demonstrated in two DMC\n\n    locomotion environments (Walker Walk, Cheetah Run). Generalization to\n\n    non-locomotion tasks requires further investigation.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_051\n  description: Cartpole CIVO 触发\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\n  result_rationale: 依赖 plan_050 baseline，无法在 deadline 前完成。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 跳过，与 plan_050 相同原因。\n- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_052\n  description: Cartpole 因果控制\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\n  result_rationale: 依赖 plan_050 baseline，无法在 deadline 前完成。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 跳过，与 plan_050 相同原因。\n- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n  plan_id: plan_060\n  description: 基于 RSSM 预测不确定性截断 imagination rollout\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K: 580\n    vs_baseline: -37%\n    nve_peak: 1.3\n    collapse: false\n    collapse_rate_if_multi_seed: ~25% (1/4 estimate)\n    truncation_rate_avg: 40% of dt=2 steps truncated\n    effective_horizon: ~11 steps (vs H=15 nominal)\n  result_rationale: 'Uncertainty-gated truncation 在 RSSM 预测不确定性超过阈值时截断 imagination。\n\n    Median 档预期：方法在单 seed 试点中表现有希望（无崩溃，nve<1.5×），\n\n    但性能恢复有限（仅 ~63% baseline），因为 truncation 过于激进\n\n    （40% dt=2 步被截断，effective horizon 缩短至 11 步）。\n\n    这说明 truncation 地址了 Pathway A 但可能引入新的性能限制。\n\n    作为 Discussion 中的 future work 方向有价值，但作为独立 contribution 不足。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - Truncation rate vs training step 叠加 NVE 曲线\n  analysis: 'Pilot 结果可放 appendix 或 Discussion 的 future work 段。\n\n    不足以作为论文的 mitigation contribution（那需要多 seed + 跨环境验证）。\n\n    '\n- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n  plan_id: plan_040\n  description: 第三环境（非提交优先级）\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED_BEFORE_DEADLINE\n    gpu_hours_needed: 45\n  result_rationale: 'P2 优先级 + 45 GPU hours 需求，在 CoRL deadline 前不可行。\n\n    即使 Cartpole 完成，Hopper 也超出预算。留作后续工作。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: P2 实验，不影响当前提交。\n- name: '008f_s3 borderline NVE (registry: exp_008f_s3_no_dt_embed_walker)'\n  plan_id: registry_only\n  description: Walker Walk 008f 第 3 个 seed——median 档 borderline case\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K: 250\n    nve_peak: 1.42\n    nve_peak_step: 85000\n    nve_105K: 1.1\n    collapse: false\n    borderline_for_threshold: true\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：''008f_s3 NVE 在 1.2-1.6×（borderline，削弱 threshold\n    完美分类）''。\n\n    seed 0 nve peak=1.02, seed 1 nve peak=1.05, seed 2 (009c) nve peak=1.26。\n\n    seed 3 预期 nve peak ~1.42×，接近但未超过 1.5× 阈值。如果 Cheetah control\n\n    没有提供 borderline case，008f_s3 就是削弱分类精度的数据点。\n\n    即使 nve peak <1.5×，其值（1.42×）足够高以引起审稿人对阈值鲁棒性的质疑。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '008f_s3 + Cheetah control seed 2 合计提供 1-2 个 borderline cases，\n\n    将 NVE 1.5× 阈值精度从 perfect 降至 ~83%。\n\n    '\n- name: '018v2 Full-SGS 确认分析 (registry: exp_018v2_full_sgs_walker_s1)'\n  plan_id: registry_only\n  description: Full-SGS 消除 CIVO 但不恢复性能\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K: 448\n    vs_baseline: 49% (448/916)\n    nve_sustained: 1.05\n    nve_peak: 1.25\n    civo_eliminated: true\n    performance_recovery: partial (49%)\n    civo_independent_contribution_pp: 28\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档预期 full_sgs_018v2_nve_sustained 在 0.8-1.3× 区间，\n\n    eval 仅恢复到 ~49% baseline。018v2 通过 Full-SGS（移除 observation\n\n    decoder 对 dt_emb 的 93% 梯度通路）消除 CIVO（nve ≤ 1.25×），\n\n    但性能仅恢复到 448（vs 008d 崩溃至 131，baseline 916）。\n\n    CIVO 独立贡献 = 008d@105K baseline ratio - 018v2@105K baseline ratio\n\n    = (916-131)/916 - (916-448)/916 ≈ 86% - 51% = 35pp（上界）。\n\n    但 median 档承认 inherent multi-dt cost confound：018v2 的 49%\n\n    恢复意味着至少 51% 的退化来自 inherent cost（非 CIVO 因素），\n\n    使 CIVO 独立贡献的下界为 ~20pp。范围：20-35pp。\n\n    Sensitivity analysis 展示不同分解假设下的结果。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: CIVO decomposition sensitivity analysis\n    rows:\n    - assumption: 'Upper bound: all 008d-018v2 gap = CIVO'\n      civo_pp: 35\n      inherent_cost_pp: 51\n    - assumption: 'Mid estimate: 018v2 inherent cost = 008a inherent cost'\n      civo_pp: 28\n      inherent_cost_pp: 58\n    - assumption: 'Lower bound: inherent cost dominant'\n      civo_pp: 20\n      inherent_cost_pp: 66\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar chart: baseline performance decomposed into retained + inherent cost\n    + CIVO contribution'\n  analysis: 'CIVO 独立贡献 20-35pp 是 median 档的核心量化发现。\n\n    论文措辞从 \"35pp independent contribution\" 改为 \"20-35pp range,\n\n    with the upper bound limited by potential confounding from inherent\n\n    multi-dt training cost.\" Sensitivity analysis 是必须的附加材料。'\n","numLines":1048,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1048}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01AXjx2VVJmM4VsTRqr6kLda","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the paper and review context carefully. I need to dispatch two reviewers:\n- R1: Methods + Experiments\n- R2: Novelty + Related Work\n\nThen conduct a full roundtable (Step 1: independent reviews → Step 2: cross-sharing → Step 3: convergence → Step 4: synthesis).\n\nLet me first thoroughly read and understand the paper and the review context, then dispatch the two reviewers in parallel.\n\nThe paper is about \"Diagnosing Conditioning-Induced Value Overestimation in Variable-Rate World-Model Imagination.\" It studies variable-rate imagination in DreamerV3, finding that trained temporal embeddings (dt_embedding) trigger CIVO - a pathological feedback loop. Key findings:\n\n\n- All variable-rate configurations underperform the dt=1 baseline, with trained dt_embedding reliably inducing normalized value estimates above 1.5× (achieving 83% classification accuracy)\n- Removing or freezing dt_embedding eliminates CIVO but creates alternative failure modes\n- The dt=1 imagination eliminates one failure pathway but the second pathway still emerges at the same 50% rate\n- CIVO contributes independently to performance degradation by 20-35 percentage points\n- The evaluation is limited to just two environments (Walker Walk and Cheetah Run), with Cartpole experiments incomplete\n\nFrom the review context, I'm noting that the NVE 1.5× threshold accuracy drops to around 83% compared to perfect classification in ideal conditions.\n\nCheetah control shows borderline cases, and the cross-environment narrative is directionally consistent rather than fully replicated across all tested domains. The CIVO contribution spans a 20-35 percentage point range rather than a fixed value, and the 008e_v3 variant exhibits Pathway B collapse at the same 50% rate. Now I'm setting up to run the two reviewers as parallel agents to evaluate these findings.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41317,"cache_read_input_tokens":22965,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41317},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"570624ec-b17e-41f5-bcd8-41108a80bdcf","uuid":"460b4527-b1cd-430d-936c-94795685587d"}
